Work in this project is about the multi-app (laramonde) stack code in this repository only.

- Do not access any of the user's remote servers from this project: no `ssh`, `scp`, `rsync`, remote `docker`/`docker context`, or similar against hosts such as 167.71.217.2, 139.59.98.41, 128.199.198.19 or any other server.
